  {
   "id": 70,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "Firmware: desired (Annona)",
   "description": "What each unit should run — PUT /units/<id>/firmware (card #304). Empty until a version is set.\n\nGenerated by landingzones/ceres/dashboards/generate.py (card #307) — edit the generator, not this file.",
